cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Sovereign Hospital Federation: leaderless federated learning with verifiable receipts"
abstract: >-
  A coordinator-free (leaderless, peer-to-peer) federated learning demonstrator
  for hospitals. Five hospital peers gossip signed contributions over a CRDT,
  each runs ACFA aggregation locally and co-signs the resulting state root, and
  a model is installed only with a quorum of matching co-signatures. It
  includes differential privacy (DP-SGD with RDP accounting), pairwise-mask
  secure aggregation, privacy-attack evidence, an offline-verifiable evidence
  bundle, and Lean 4 proofs of CRDT convergence and quorum intersection.
  Synthetic data only.
